The measurements come from the Kaiterra devices of the user, through the
official Kaiterra API (https://dev.kaiterra.com), with the API key of the user.
Data provided by Kaiterra.

The files under test/fixtures are built after the examples of the Kaiterra API
documentation (https://dev.kaiterra.com, version 2025-02-26).

The US Air Quality Index is computed with the breakpoints published by the
US Environmental Protection Agency (Technical Assistance Document for the
Reporting of Daily Air Quality, PM2.5 revision of February 2024).

